{c: Verse 1}
[E] Nazrein Milte Hi Nazron Se,        [A] Nazron Ko Chura [E] ye
[E] Kaisi Yeh Haya Teri,        Jo Tu Pal [A] kon Ko Jhuka [E] ye
[A] Rabb Jo Poshida Hai [E] Usko Nihare Tu,        [A] Aur Jo Garveeda Hai [B] Usko Taale [E] Tu
[E] Teri Jhalak Asharfi Srivalli,        [Bm] Naina Madak Bar [E] fi
