[E] Sar Ye Jhukne Na Du [B] Duniya Ke Aage,        [E] Par Teri Payal Dekhu [A] Kar Ke Sar Niche
[G] Na Tamanna Heera Panna,        [A] Mujhko Hai Bas Tera Banna
[G] Ek Jhalak Teri Aankon Mein,        [E] Khwab Saja Jaaye
